<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My eyes be set on You, Lord;</l><l>Each pleasure and each pain</l><l>Would make me look at You, Lord,</l><l>God’s riches and grace to gain.</l><l>If I am full and think I’m rich,</l><l>Empty, You’ll send me away;</l><l>Continually I’m hungry, Lord.</l><l>My heart on You will stay.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
